cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the SplitAligner preprint below. A software DOI will be minted at the first tagged release (placeholder recorded under identifiers)."
title: "SplitAlignerR: Split-Based Branch Mapping and Coordinate Auditing for Phylogenomics"
abstract: "An R implementation (scaffold, v0.0.1) of the SplitAligner branch-identity coordinate system for phylogenomics under missing taxa and gene-tree discordance. Ships the deterministic Catnip10 10-tip coordinate-audit benchmark expected oracle outputs as bundled data."
